// A long act keeps a head window and a tail window. Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE head ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE tail ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG head tail

IMPULSE head 1
IMPULSE tail 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY tail
DECIDE tail
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "tailwin" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
